WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
Stop doing busywork.
[A cursor labelled Construct answers an email on a live desktop]

00:02.000 --> 00:04.000
Construct gives AI its own computer.

00:04.000 --> 00:06.000
It browses. It writes. It emails. It schedules.

00:06.000 --> 00:08.000
Every click, on the record.

00:08.000 --> 00:10.000
Loved on Product Hunt.
#1 Product of the Day. #5 Product of the Week, Productivity.

00:10.000 --> 00:12.000
Some days you want to watch it work.
Some days you just want it done.

00:12.000 --> 00:14.000
Zen Mode.
[The cursor clicks Zen Mode. The desktop tilts back, still running.]

00:14.000 --> 00:16.000
Looks like the chat you already use.

00:16.000 --> 00:18.000
Just ask.
[Typed: Research our top 5 competitors and brief me every Monday.]

00:18.000 --> 00:20.000
Runs every Monday. On its own.
[Every Monday 8:00, research the web, draft brief, email me]

00:20.000 --> 00:22.000
Same crew.
[Agents named Researcher, Inbox, and Analyst, each with a live status]

00:22.000 --> 00:24.000
Same inbox.

00:24.000 --> 00:26.000
Same memory.
[The memory "Prefers briefs on Mondays" lights up]

00:26.000 --> 00:28.000
You approve. It ships.

00:28.000 --> 00:30.000
Curious what it's doing?
[The cursor clicks Open OS]

00:30.000 --> 00:34.000
Same computer. Still working.
[The desktop returns mid-task: a pricing page in the browser and the competitor brief being written]

00:34.000 --> 00:39.500
Construct Zen Mode. Full power. Familiar face.
construct.computer
